Parity reproduced from the web source:
  - Data: SI °C samples from the drive query, converted at the display boundary via
    convertTempSectionFromSI (°C identity / °F = c*9/5+32), exactly mirroring
    useDriveDetailData's convertTempFromSI(unitPrefs.temperature). ADR-004 SI-on-disk honored.
  - Gate: chartData.length > 1 && stats.hasAnyTemp -> tiles + chart, else empty
    ("No temperature telemetry is available for this drive.").
  - Up-to-6 stat tiles (Outside/Inside/Driver/Passenger avg, Climate status, Fan Avg·Max),
    each rendered only when present; fmtNumber (precision 2) + fmtInt parity.
  - 4 line series (outside/inside/driver/passenger), each only if that array is non-empty;
    web stroke hues mapped to brand chart tokens (Speed=blue#3b82f6, Power=purple#a855f7 exact).
  - useSyncedReferenceLineX + ChartTooltip -> native chartXSelection + RuleMark + tooltip.
  - States widened to full P4 envelope: loading / empty / error(retry) / stale(chip+auto-refresh)
    / offline(cached+chip) / content. view.opened telemetry (slug "TemperatureSection") on appear.
  - Every literal resolves through the P1/S10 facade; no hardcoded English in code.
  - VoiceOver: chart aria label + live summary value; per-tile combined labels; reduce-motion honored.

